.TH CHARBUF_SKIP_UNTIL 3
.SH NAME
charbuf_skip_until \- skip characters until a delimiter is found
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <charbuf.h>
.P
.BI "ssize_t charbuf_skip_until(charbuf* " b ", int " c ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR charbuf_skip_until ()
advances the read pointer of buffer
.I b
until the character
.I c
is encountered.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the number of characters skipped before reaching the delimiter,
or a negative value on error or EOF.